/*
Magnetic reaction-wheel momentum unloading

Operational context
A momentum manager requests a magnetic torque that reduces stored wheel momentum while respecting rod capability.

Input interface
momentum_error_nms and field_body_t: finite body vectors. torque_gain_s_inv >=0.
max_dipole_a_m2 >=0. command and achievable_torque_nm: outputs.

