Magnetorquer dipole-to-PWM conversion

Operational context
A B-dot command is converted to signed PWM duty while preserving requested average dipole.

Input interface
finite requested vector, positive finite full_scale, minimum_duty in [0,1], output command.

Mathematical definition
For each axis compute `d=m/full_scale` and apply every row of this normative decision table.

| Normalized magnitude | Output magnitude | Promotion bit |
|---|---:|---:|
