| `minimum_duty <= |d| <= 1` | `|d|` | clear |
| `|d| > 1` | `1` | clear |

Restore the original sign after selecting the output magnitude.

Required processing
Apply minimum pulse after upper clipping; exact zero remains zero.

Output contract
ADCS_OK with duty vector and bit mask for minimum-pulse promotion; failure output zero.

Boundary and failure handling
