that capture for pulse_cycles unless every request component falls below the stop threshold,
which cancels immediately into COOLDOWN.  A requested vector opposing the last nonzero
capture enters REVERSAL_WAIT and emits zero for reversal_blank_cycles before returning IDLE.
After each completed or cancelled pulse, COOLDOWN emits zero for cooldown_cycles.

Count emitted pulse cycles in thermal_cycles.  Reaching max_thermal_cycles enters INHIBIT;
INHIBIT emits zero and leaves only after recovery_cycles consecutive requests below the stop
threshold.  A nonquiet request clears recovery evidence.  Disable clears all state and thermal
history.  Report torque=m cross B every call.

